      "message": "test: check w8, not w7, after creating the avoid_reuse wallet\n\nSince c5d3787367 the avoid_reuse section of wallet_createwallet calls\nw7.walletpassphrase, repeating the assertion made on w7 just before it,\nso the w8 wallet it creates was never checked for encryption. Call it\non w8 to check that creating a wallet with an empty passphrase and\navoid_reuse=true leaves it unencrypted.",
